{"id":"58f141112520223a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set.md","title":"ZFC Model9 Model Guessing Set","display":"df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set — ZFC Model9 Model Guessing Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set"],"display":"df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set — ZFC Model9 Model Guessing Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set — ZFC Model9 Model Guessing Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,X\\in V\">\\(M,X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^\\omega\">\\([X]^\\omega\\)</span> is the countable-subset set defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}countable\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{z\\subseteq X:|z|=\\aleph_0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}countable\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{z\\subseteq X:|z|=\\aleph_0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S(M,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq M\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in M\\cap[X]^\\omega\\;(A\\cap z\\in M)\\right]\\to\\exists B\\in M\\;(B\\cap X=A)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S(M,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq M\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in M\\cap[X]^\\omega\\;(A\\cap z\\in M)\\right]\\to\\exists B\\in M\\;(B\\cap X=A)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的可数内部片段所近似的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span>，都由某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in M\">\\(B\\in M\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上正确猜中。</li>\n<li>结论使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\cap X=A\">\\(B\\cap X=A\\)</span>；原式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\cap M=Y\\cap M\">\\(Z\\cap M=Y\\cap M\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq M\">\\(Y\\subseteq M\\)</span> 时无故要求猜测集在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 上没有额外元素。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"[X]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}countable\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{z\\subseteq X:|z|=\\aleph_0\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}model\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ModelGuessingSet}_S(M,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq M\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall z\\in M\\cap[X]^\\omega\\;(A\\cap z\\in M)\\right]\\to\\exists B\\in M\\;(B\\cap X=A)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B\\cap X=A","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\cap M=Y\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2821","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set.md|58-df-zfc-model9-model-guessing-set]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}